  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Cluedo is a classic mystery board game in which players assume the roles
    of suspects attempting to solve a murder. The objective is to determine which
    character committed the crime, which weapon was used, and in which room it occurred.
    At the start of the game, one card from each category\u2014Suspect, Weapon, and
    Room\u2014is secretly placed in a confidential case file, while the remaining
    cards are dealt among the players.\n\nPlayers take turns moving around the board,
    entering rooms, and making suggestions about the crime. When a suggestion is
    made, other players must privately disprove it if they can by showing one matching
    card. Through careful observation, deduction, and note-taking, players eliminate
    possibilities and narrow down the correct combination of suspect, weapon, and
    location.\n\nAt any point during their turn, a player may make an accusation
    by declaring their solution. If the accusation is correct, they win the game.
    If incorrect, they are eliminated from making further accusations but must continue
    to reveal cards when required, allowing the remaining players to continue their
    investigation until the mystery is solved."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
